#: ../../source/docs/common-bluerobotics-ping.rst:5
#: 664aa209d0324c3f9c57c51d7a561be3
msgid "Blue Robotics Ping Underwater Sonar"
msgstr "Blue Robotics Ping 水下声呐"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bluerobotics-ping.rst:7
#: 8670918d9d7d4cd39cf23f5a591a653f
msgid ""
"The `Blue Robotics Underwater Sonar <https://bluerobotics.com/store/sensors-"
"sonars-cameras/sonar/ping-sonar-r2-rp/>`__ is a single-beam encosounder with"
" a maximum range of 100m, a beam width of 25deg and a maximum depth rating "
"of 300m.  More details can be found in the `Technical Details section of the"
" product page on Blue Robotics <https://bluerobotics.com/store/sensors-"
"sonars-cameras/sonar/ping-sonar-r2-rp/#tab-technical-details>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Blue Robotics 水下声呐 <https://bluerobotics.com/store/sensors-sonars-"
"cameras/sonar/ping-sonar-r2-rp/>`__ "
"是一款单波束回声测深仪，最大量程为100m，波束宽度为25度，最大耐压深度为300m。更多详细信息可在 `Blue Robotics "
"产品页面的技术详情部分 <https://bluerobotics.com/store/sensors-sonars-"
"cameras/sonar/ping-sonar-r2-rp/#tab-technical-details>`__ 中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bluerobotics-ping.rst:11
#: e2fbae8dcc5547d0886ad02c1e862264
msgid ""
"Rover-4.1.0 (and higher) require the Ping sensor be running firmware version"
" 3.28 (or higher).  See below for how to upgrade the Ping's firmware."
msgstr "Rover-4.1.0（及以上版本）要求 Ping 传感器运行固件版本 3.28（或更高）。升级 Ping 固件的方法见下文。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bluerobotics-ping.rst:14
#: b74c1e0ea10946dd89d3d0ae979ee3cb
msgid "Where to Buy"
msgstr "购买渠道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bluerobotics-ping.rst:16
#: 019c5d2396e64bc5b7422f5b82bb32bd
msgid ""
"This sensor can be purchased directly from `Blue Robotics "
"<https://bluerobotics.com/store/sensors-sonars-cameras/sonar/ping-"
"sonar-r2-rp/>`__"
msgstr ""
"本传感器可直接从 `Blue Robotics <https://bluerobotics.com/store/sensors-sonars-"
"cameras/sonar/ping-sonar-r2-rp/>`__ 购买。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bluerobotics-ping.rst:17
#: eb5fe117bc7f4b538513e02c1595d5c5
msgid ""
"Optionally the `BLUART USB to Serial RS485 adapter "
"<https://bluerobotics.com/store/comm-control-power/tether-"
"interface/bluart-r1-rp/>`__ allows connecting the sensor to a PC for "
"testing, or to a Companion computer"
msgstr ""
"可选配 `BLUART USB 转 RS485 串口适配器 <https://bluerobotics.com/store/comm-control-"
"power/tether-interface/bluart-r1-rp/>`__，用于将传感器连接到PC进行测试，或连接至伴飞计算机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bluerobotics-ping.rst:20
#: b7d237a4d4d5445dbe9e5c10c84cba59
msgid "Connecting to the Autopilot"
msgstr "连接至飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bluerobotics-ping.rst:22
#: f785f71b71644c108a78e80004358a5f
msgid ""
"For a serial connection you can use any spare Serial/UART port.  The diagram"
" below shows how to connect to SERIAL2."
msgstr "对于串行连接，可使用任意空闲的串口/UART。下图展示了如何连接至SERIAL2。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bluerobotics-ping.rst:27
#: 09923fe4de504599869d085e3d57d2a8
msgid ""
"If the SERIAL2 port on the autopilot is being used then the following "
"parameters should be set:"
msgstr "若使用飞控的SERIAL2端口，应设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-bluerobotics-ping.rst:29
#: 754c4405de7341bdb1b6717ec2cb270d
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 9 (Lidar)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 9（激光雷达）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bluerobotics-ping.rst:30
#: 0a546e9fe3dd4147a342dc770751d3f4
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 115 (115200 baud)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 115（115200 波特率）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bluerobotics-ping.rst:31
#: e658296ee88043f1a6bfbb11afe8142a
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 23 (BlueRoboticsPing)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 23（BlueRoboticsPing）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bluerobotics-ping.rst:32
#: 0b6a50823e244f2ba24e230e2b705892
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.3"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.3"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bluerobotics-ping.rst:33
#: bdff4e0948da484f805b9d1a83b7d64b
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 96.  This is the distance in meters that "
"the rangefinder can reliably read."
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 96。这是测距仪可靠读取的距离（单位：米）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bluerobotics-ping.rst:34
#: c15580fcd720400d9c1a873629661ea3
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_ORIENT <RNGFND1_ORIENT>` = 25 (down) if mounted on a boat"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_ORIENT <RNGFND1_ORIENT>` = 25（朝下），安装于船只时使用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bluerobotics-ping.rst:37
#: 55b52370ce4349ba891285977c271a31
msgid "PingViewer to test and upgrade the sensor"
msgstr "使用PingViewer测试和升级传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bluerobotics-ping.rst:39
#: 724d9fe7b3f645cb8eee0b557ed08dde
msgid ""
"`BlueRobotic's PingViewer <https://docs.bluerobotics.com/ping-viewer/>`__ "
"can be used to test the sensor and `upgrade the firmware "
"<https://docs.bluerobotics.com/ping-viewer/firmware-update/>`__. There is "
"`an open source sonar firmware <https://github.com/bluerobotics/ping-"
"firmware-oss>`__ which can be used to test modified signal processing and "
"rangefinding algorithms, or create fully custom behaviors."
msgstr ""
"`BlueRobotics PingViewer <https://docs.bluerobotics.com/ping-viewer/>`__ "
"可用于测试传感器及 `升级固件 <https://docs.bluerobotics.com/ping-viewer/firmware-"
"update/>`__。此外还有一个 `开源声呐固件 <https://github.com/bluerobotics/ping-firmware-"
"oss>`__，可用于测试自定义信号处理和测距算法，或创建完全定制的行为。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bluerobotics-ping.rst:41
#: 6c4dd6ee7d594d199bf89f3b6b2fdba8
msgid ""
"Connect the Ping to your PC using a USB cable and `BLUART USB to Serial "
"RS485 adapter <https://bluerobotics.com/store/comm-control-power/tether-"
"interface/bluart-r1-rp/>`__"
msgstr ""
"使用USB线缆和 `BLUART USB 转 RS485 串口适配器 <https://bluerobotics.com/store/comm-"
"control-power/tether-interface/bluart-r1-rp/>`__ 将 Ping 连接至电脑。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bluerobotics-ping.rst:42
#: 4b0d6d906b784b85a46f81da7a33aaf6
msgid "Download, install and run the PingViewer"
msgstr "下载、安装并运行PingViewer。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bluerobotics-ping.rst:43
#: df0b78cddf69494eb87fb8071faf0281
msgid "From within the PingViewer application connect to the sensor"
msgstr "在PingViewer应用程序中连接至传感器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bluerobotics-ping.rst:44
#: c0c82f2c3f0f47fb8292bebd58d6688c
msgid ""
"From the upper left menu, select the gear icon, `Firmware Upgrade "
"<https://docs.bluerobotics.com/ping-viewer/firmware-update/>`__ and if "
"necessary upgrade the firmware to \"Ping_V3.28_auto\" (or higher), or "
"install a custom firmware binary"
msgstr ""
"在左上角菜单中，选择齿轮图标，点击 `固件升级 <https://docs.bluerobotics.com/ping-viewer/firmware-"
"update/>`__，若有需要请将固件升级至 「Ping_V3.28_auto」（或更高版本），或安装自定义固件二进制文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bluerobotics-ping.rst:51
#: 069aa1e4d875430189e158e068521444
msgid "Testing the sensor"
msgstr "测试传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-bluerobotics-ping.rst:53
#: ace8abe74ddf46409934eaf32a859aa2
msgid ""
"Distances read by the sensor can be seen in the Mission Planner's Flight "
"Data screen's Status tab. Look closely for \"rangefinder1\"."
msgstr "传感器读取的距离可在 Mission Planner 飞行数据界面的状态标签页中查看。请注意查找 「rangefinder1」。"
